  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Cha, +1 Str or Dex\nSpeed: 30 feet\nSkill Proficiency: Martial Arts, Medicine\nTool Proficiency: Medicine Kit\nWeapon Proficiency: Tanto, Broadsword, Katana, Odachi & Chokuto.\nSingle-Swing Practitioner: The Yamada Clan has access to a separate list of Jutsu unique to their Clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the Normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Yamada Clan Hijutsu can use either Strength or Wisdom as its casting ability score.\nAnatomical Studies: The Yamada clans skill in medicine, allows them to use their knowledge on physical anatomy to foretell an enemies actions. They can use Medicine, in place of Illusions, Martial Arts or Ninshou to take the Read the Enemy action.\n[BOX]\n| #### Art Source / All Art is sourced from official sources found for the Hells Paradise series, by Yuji Kaku |\n[/BOX]",
